      "heading": "Overview",
      "level": 1,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Student Jin Section Istan Quests Campaign Nightfall Given by Field General Hayao in Plains of Jarin or Sun Docks (Istan) Preceded by Zaishen Elite Type Secondary quest Map(s) (Click to enlarge)",
        "This quest will allow Acolyte Jin to join your party as a hero. This quest and Student Sousuke are mutually exclusive, so once this quest is completed, you won't be able to gain Acolyte Sousuke as a hero until after the completion of the Nightfall campaign."
      ]
    },
