      "heading": "Objectives",
      "level": 3,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Travel to Zehlon Reach and bond with Acolyte Jin through battle against one of Balthazar's Eternals. See Field General Hayao for your reward."
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Reward",
      "level": 3,
      "paragraphs": [
        "1,500 Experience Acolyte Jin joins your party. 125 Gold"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Walkthrough",
      "level": 2,
      "paragraphs": [
        "After talking with Field General Hayao after Zaishen Elite in the Plains of Jarin make your way to The Astralarium. Enter Zehlon Reach and proceed south to find Acolyte Jin, Balthazar's Eternal, and two Ghostly Griffons. Defeat the Eternals and report back to Field General Hayao at the Sun Docks."
      ]
    },
