  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#ACD\">Student Jin\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Section\" title=\"Quest\">Section</a>\n</th>\n<td>Istan Quests\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Given by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Field_General_Hayao\" title=\"Field General Hayao\">Field General Hayao</a> <br />in <a href=\"/wiki/Plains_of_Jarin\" title=\"Plains of Jarin\">Plains of Jarin</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Sun_Docks\" title=\"Sun Docks\">Sun Docks</a> <br />(<a href=\"/wiki/Istan\" title=\"Istan\">Istan</a>)\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Preceded by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Zaishen_Elite_(quest)\" title=\"Zaishen Elite (quest)\">Zaishen Elite</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Secondary_quest\" title=\"Secondary quest\">Secondary quest</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background-color:#ACD;\">Map(s)\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Student_Jin_Sousuke_map.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Student Jin Sousuke map.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/1/12/Student_Jin_Sousuke_map.jpg/250px-Student_Jin_Sousuke_map.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/12/Student_Jin_Sousuke_map.jpg/375px-Student_Jin_Sousuke_map.jpg 1.5x, /images/1/12/Student_Jin_Sousuke_map.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"377\" data-file-height=\"302\" /></a><br /><small>(Click to enlarge)</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>This quest will allow <a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte_Jin\" title=\"Acolyte Jin\">Acolyte Jin</a> to join your <a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">party</a> as a <a href=\"/wiki/Hero\" title=\"Hero\">hero</a>. This quest and <a href=\"/wiki/Student_Sousuke\" title=\"Student Sousuke\">Student Sousuke</a> are mutually exclusive, so once this quest is completed, you won't be able to gain <a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte_Sousuke\" title=\"Acolyte Sousuke\">Acolyte Sousuke</a> as a hero until after the completion of the Nightfall campaign.  \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Quest_information\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quest information</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Requirements\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Requirements</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objectives</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Reward\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Walkthrough\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Walkthrough</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#NPCs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPCs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Allies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Allies</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Foes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Foes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Initial_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Initial dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Intermediate_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Intermediate dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Reward_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward dialogue</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_information\">Quest information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Jin&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Quest information\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requirements\">Requirements</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Jin&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Requirements\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Student_Sousuke\" title=\"Student Sousuke\">Student Sousuke</a> <i>neither</i> active <i>nor</i> completed</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objectives\">Objectives</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Jin&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Objectives\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Travel to <a href=\"/wiki/Zehlon_Reach\" title=\"Zehlon Reach\">Zehlon Reach</a> and bond with <a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte_Jin\" title=\"Acolyte Jin\">Acolyte Jin</a> through battle against one of <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar%27s_Eternal\" title=\"Balthazar&#39;s Eternal\">Balthazar's Eternals</a>.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/wiki/Field_General_Hayao\" title=\"Field General Hayao\">Field General Hayao</a> for your reward.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward\">Reward</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Jin&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Reward\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>1,500 <a href=\"/wiki/Experience\" title=\"Experience\">Experience</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte_Jin\" title=\"Acolyte Jin\">Acolyte Jin</a> joins your party.</li>\n<li>125 <a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Walkthrough\">Walkthrough</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Jin&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Walkthrough\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After talking with Field General Hayao after <a href=\"/wiki/Zaishen_Elite_(quest)\" title=\"Zaishen Elite (quest)\">Zaishen Elite</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Plains_of_Jarin\" title=\"Plains of Jarin\">Plains of Jarin</a> make your way to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Astralarium\" title=\"The Astralarium\">The Astralarium</a>. Enter Zehlon Reach and proceed south to find Acolyte Jin, Balthazar's Eternal, and two Ghostly Griffons. Defeat the Eternals and report back to Field General Hayao at the <a href=\"/wiki/Sun_Docks\" title=\"Sun Docks\">Sun Docks</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"NPCs\">NPCs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Jin&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: NPCs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Allies\">Allies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Jin&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Allies\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Humans</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ranger\"><img alt=\"Ranger\" src=\"/images/d/dc/Ranger-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 11 (20) <a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte_Jin\" title=\"Acolyte Jin\">Acolyte Jin</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Foes\">Foes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Jin&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Foes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ghost\" title=\"Ghost\">Ghosts</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Warrior\"><img alt=\"Warrior\" src=\"/images/3/3b/Warrior-tango-icon-20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 20 (20) <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar%27s_Eternal\" title=\"Balthazar&#39;s Eternal\">Balthazar's Eternal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cross_grey_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Unknown\"><img alt=\"Unknown\" src=\"/images/e/e0/Cross_grey_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a> 16 (24) <a href=\"/wiki/Ghostly_Griffon\" title=\"Ghostly Griffon\">Ghostly Griffon</a> (two)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Jin&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Initial_dialogue\">Initial dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Jin&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Initial dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>Field General Hayao</b>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>\"The <b>Zaishen</b> are sworn blades of <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar</a>, loyal to the end. You have chosen <b>Jin</b> as your pupil. It is time to show your student what it is to be fierce through actions, not words. Together you must defeat one of <b>Balthazar's Eternals</b> in combat. Only through victory in the face of death will you be forever bonded with your sister in arms. You will find the Eternal in Zehlon Reach.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tick_green.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Yes\"><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/5/52/Tick_green.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Accept:</b> <i>\"We'd best not keep Balthazar waiting.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icon_No_ingame.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"No\"><img alt=\"No\" src=\"/images/0/09/Icon_No_ingame.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Decline:</b> <i>\"Balthazar, eh?  I think I hear my mom calling me....\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tango-question-mark.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ask\"><img alt=\"Ask\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Tango-question-mark.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Ask:</b> <i>\"<b>Acolyte Jin</b> is in <b>the <small>[<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Sic\"><span title=\"Unlike the Student Sousuke quest, the is lowercase here.\"><i>sic</i></span></a>]</small> Zehlon Reach</b>. She will call forth the <b>Eternal</b> once you arrive.\"</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Intermediate_dialogue\">Intermediate dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Jin&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Intermediate dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><b>Acolyte Jin:</b> <i>\"Ready yourself for battle, <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_the_Sunspears\" title=\"Order of the Sunspears\">Sunspear</a>. The Eternals are not to be taken lightly.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><b>Acolyte Jin:</b> <i>\"Excellent battle tactics. I am honored to be trained by one so versed in combat.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward_dialogue\">Reward dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Student_Jin&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Reward dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>Field General Hayao</b>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>\"As her trainer, I think it best you knew something about your pupil. Jin is from a small town on the <a href=\"/wiki/Cantha\" title=\"Cantha\">Cantha</a> coast, and is mainly self-taught. Her family was slain by monsters when she was a small girl. As an orphan, she focused her sorrow and rage on vengeance. Even before coming to the Zaishen, she was an effective fighter. She is quiet and taciturn when off the battlefield, methodical and deadly when on. She never backs down from a fight. Good luck, hero. Go with the blessing of Balthazar.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008222204\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 494/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5022/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2249/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   25.814      1 -total\n 38.67%    9.982      1 Template:Quest_infobox\n 31.99%    8.257      1 Template:Offer_dialog\n  9.21%    2.377      1 Template:R\n  8.74%    2.255      1 Template:Infobox_campaign_row\n  8.20%    2.117      1 Template:Standard_prerequisites\n  6.83%    1.762      1 Template:Infobox_requirements_row\n  6.33%    1.635      1 Template:No\n  6.14%    1.584      1 Template:Sic\n  5.93%    1.530      2 Template:Profession_icon_sizes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key en_wiki:pcache:idhash:25649-0!canonical and timestamp 20261008222204 and revision id 2627811.\n -->\n</div>"
